-933e-7c71999b56ed", "M", "Good. That means you've met her."], "7": ["0964506f-8540-4748-8aee-4a3587e15ac5", "-", ""], "8": ["62134164-9099-4b04-9d4a-26ef777b12b2", "-", ""], "9": ["3bb50387-5ac1-4447-9b3b-e0457333f0b3", "-", ""], "10": ["f7811b43-0c64-4012-a4f0-165466b2113e", "K", "Don't touch that. Do you know what's in there?"], "11": ["60b53ea6-b158-4a28-9903-de7c3b1834da", "A", "Sorry, sorry. I only clean around."], "12": ["8ed8e76f-83cb-457e-bdb6-6a849f992a92", "H", "Kyle. Her name is Mrs. Alvarez. She's been here longer than you have. She's emptied your trash every night for two years."], "13": ["d31c1e4b-cb1d-4419-9db7-8e3265272f7a", "H", "Say thank you."], "14": ["cd4a777a-e67f-46f6-b1d4-2a794d35e971", "K", "Thank you."], "15": ["5c391b8f-03bc-4bfc-a0ec-5937243cde32", "A", "You didn't have to do that, Miss Moore."], "16": ["cca984a7-7029-4f56-bcfe-d4c475372426", "H", "My dad always says nobody notices the people who keep things clean until they stop."], "17": ["20394c43-1edb-4788-8834-278dd7f83734", "A", "Your father sounds like a smart man."], "18": ["2502e530-f7a7-4f2c-84f2-e0cc1d6bbfdc", "H", "He is."], "30": ["4d49e868-412c-444a-b417-232b30987350", "-", ""], "31": ["43f7d7a2-c6b4-4b6b-8d0f-651c231bfdc2", "C", "Julian says you grew up in the city. Which part?"], "32": ["f2c4d16d-2169-44a8-aa99-058951e03fc0", "H", "East side. Near the river."], "33": ["c5502b6f-6453-4775-b55f-f9795d666778", "C", "Oh. Near the river."], "34": ["9f10ffb9-9fce-452c-a51e-b911f27704c3", "C", "And your parents?"], "35": ["d5d694fa-2949-4ca4-b625-90dbb0fac237", "H", "My mom died when I was nine."], "36": ["a43116d2-0565-4a5e-80f2-02bfa286e57a", "C", "I'm sorry. And your father?"], "37": ["75038c50-a9c3-4f63-b008-6765a48bf953", "H", "He's retired. He travels a lot."], "38": ["7f7f16b5-41dd-4442-b83f-bde3058f206a", "C", "What's his handicap?"], "39": ["25beb5e7-bbce-4fa6-a092-a535eb54bd1b", "H", "I'm sorry?"], "40": ["b6aa52a5-f7f2-4dc6-85ee-0773e2e6cfdb", "J", "She means golf, Mom. Not everybody plays golf."], "41": ["d7371a88-ffb3-4792-a5f4-6f40c9bf7d56", "J", "She never lets me meet him. I'm starting to think he doesn't exist."], "42": ["dd0d0e03-907a-4b75-a920-497028611821", "R", "Or he's met your mother."], "43": ["e8391bcd-3647-4282-9faa-9bb78c599d01", "C", "Walter. There's a fingerprint on this."], "44": ["56ea10ce-f24c-47d4-aa09-cfcd58902985", "W", "Apologies, madam."], "45": ["a7a6c248-a699-44ea-9158-080f0b0bda3c", "H", "She asked me what my father's handicap was. I nearly said bad knees."], "46": ["a4395b3a-27f2-4949-8380-7ee2cd59144c", "J", "It went great. She only checked one glass for fingerprints. That's love."], "47": ["a96e2c97-b4ad-415a-bf3a-cd567d44d313", "J", "I had a whole plan. A violinist, a boat. I'm doing it in my parents' driveway because I can't wait anymore."], "48": ["d50333a0-e318-4880-9b6c-d9152c40b2a7", "H", "Julian, get up, you're kneeling on gravel."], "49": ["b55d6a94-0cbc-4a76-890a-87f4a7fbd738", "J", "Is that a yes?"], "50": ["fc81b794-cea4-4ada-82c2-37bd644f90c1", "H", "Yes. Yes. Get up."], "51": ["eddd839e-6d4c-4608-aff9-4b47befbeeb4", "-", ""], "52": ["4fa60c16-63ff-441e-84aa-fc8ef3ca8bce", "J", "Mom wants an engagement dinner. I said you'd host. Your place, your rules."], "53": ["2afda45e-162f-4fe5-b8ee-6672ba20e9cf", "H", "My place?"], "54": ["a8a0e33c-aa4c-4c7d-a4c6-9268bf9108e1", "E", "Well, look at that. He did good."], "55": ["876a41eb-c13d-4517-bf63-e063c538566b", "H", "He did okay."], "56": ["6a025905-886c-486f-ade7-43f17eb1e854", "E", "Your mother got a ring out of a gumball machine. Wore it eleven years."], "57": ["72848710-1120-49cb-8bd4-a75e75fbb940", "H", "The dinner's Saturday. Here."], "58": ["2fb253eb-7c5b-4038-b8f0-de8c807696fa", "E", "I'll get the grey suit cleaned."], "59": ["02a98a5b-4092-48c2-b20c-cb05356d69da", "H", "About that."], "60": ["c104d604-dfa9-45b6-9b52-256fa73477bb", "H", "Would you mind staying in the cottage? Just for the dinner. It's not about you. They're just, Celes